    <item>
      <title>Namibia convenes Women Parliamentary Caucus</title>
      <link>https://www.parliament.na/namibia-covenes-women-parliamentary-caucus/</link>
      <description>Andreas Sheya Namibia’s female parliamentarians, from both the National Assembly and National Council convened in Swakopmund from 14 to 15 March 2026 for the Parliamentary Women Caucus, reaffirming their commitment to advancing gender equality and strengthening women’s participation in governance. The gathering was officially opened by Speaker of the National Assembly, Saara Kuugongelwa-Amadhila, and attended…</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.parliament.na/namibia-covenes-women-parliamentary-caucus/</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://www.parliament.na/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/women-cacas.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Mar 2026 10:35:33 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
